      <h2 class="section-heading on-dark" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">Helena Roerich and the Agni Yoga Books</h2>
      <div class="two-col-grid" style="gap:4rem;">
        <div>
          <p class="about-body">Helena Roerich recorded the Agni Yoga series in cooperation with the Masters of Wisdom. The books were composed between 1924 and 1938 and are studied by readers around the world as a body of spiritual instruction for the new era.</p>
          <p class="about-body">Nicholas Roerich's paintings, cultural work, and peace efforts stand beside the Teaching as expressions of the same striving toward beauty, culture, and the protection of the highest values.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
